0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Translation,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,2,23,23,34,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:59.92,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rumble Ball!Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.68,0:01:58.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rumble ball's effects last three minutes.Dialogue: 50,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's three minutes to take you down!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.02,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Three minutes?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.56,0:02:06.90,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,You have no chance of defeating me, much less in three minutes!Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.90,0:02:09.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three minutes? That's amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.36,0:02:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three minutes? That's amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.24,0:02:16.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're about to see something interesting.Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.53,0:02:20.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Let me fight, too!Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.29,0:02:21.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rumble!Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.91,0:02:23.87,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,What...Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.87,0:02:26.25,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,did you say you could do?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.67,0:02:32.63,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Marimo's Snow-Melting Arrow!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.26,0:02:36.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Walk Point: Limb Boost!Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.14,0:02:43.69,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,A transformation?! I was expecting more!Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.69,0:02:46.40,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,In other words, you have the powers of a devil fruit...Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.48,0:02:48.77,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,a zoan, just like Dalton!Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.77,0:02:50.78,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,A reindeer human, huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heavy Point: Weight Boost!Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.36,0:02:56.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a human reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.24,0:02:57.57,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Same difference!Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.57,0:03:02.16,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,I know everything about the three-form transformation you zoans use.Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.52,0:03:05.71,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Marimo's Super Surprise Quattro Hammer!Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.62,0:03:09.75,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,I've seen all your forms.Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.92,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,You use your powers to fight, like Dalton.Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.92,0:03:15.13,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,But there's no way you can...Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.13,0:03:18.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jumping Point: Jumping Boost!Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.59,0:03:21.43,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,...take me down!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.39,0:03:27.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He jumped! Man, he can really jump!Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.40,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.78,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,What's that form?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.32,0:03:38.61,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Wasn't his hybrid form the little reindeer from earlier?! How impudent!Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.61,0:03:41.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guard Point: Guard Boost!Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.21,0:03:53.38,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Another?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.76,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Impossible!Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.47,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,I hit him dead on!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.47,0:04:02.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't work!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.43,0:04:06.06,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Zoans are only supposed to have three forms!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.06,0:04:07.89,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,What the heck are you?Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.89,0:04:09.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rumble ballDialogue: 50,0:04:09.06,0:04:12.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is a drug that disrupts the wavelength of devil fruit transformations.Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.82,0:04:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,During my five years of research,Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I found four more transformation points.Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.74,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,A seven-form transformation?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.20,0:04:23.66,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Who cares how many transformations you have?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.66,0:04:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A...Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.16,0:04:28.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A seven-form transforming reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's his damage?Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.00,0:04:34.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After hearing "seven-form transformation", he's probably on cloud nine.Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard...Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.13,0:04:39.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten about your fight against me?Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.59,0:04:42.93,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Your party trick won't fool me!Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.93,0:04:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not a trick!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.90,0:04:53.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arm Point: Arm Boost!Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.08,0:05:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.41,0:05:13.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My hooves are hard as iron! They can even destroy boulders!Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.38,0:05:14.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.13,0:05:18.80,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,You bastard, don't underestimate me!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.18,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,This'll show you!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.18,0:05:22.76,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Marimo's Super Surprise...Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.43,0:05:26.64,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Quattro Axe:Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.35,0:05:29.18,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Snow-Splitting Blade!Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.11,0:05:38.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey... The castle wall is crumbling!Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.07,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Tch! He dodged it!Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.70,0:05:44.74,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Then, how about...Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.03,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,this?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.70,0:05:49.12,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Omnidirectional Snow Splitter!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.29,0:05:57.04,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Where'd that optimism go?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.04,0:05:59.88,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,You can't win if you just keep dodging, you know!Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.56,0:06:10.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Brain Point: Brain Boost!Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.18,0:06:14.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wasn't just dodging.Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.23,0:06:18.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was searching for your weak point.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This will finish you.Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.69,0:06:21.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Scope!Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.49,0:06:32.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A... A beam! He's gonna shoot a beam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.12,0:06:33.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As if, you moron!Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.54,0:06:36.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's definitely a beam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.71,0:06:38.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care what anyone says, it's a beam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care what anyone says, it's a beam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.21,0:06:40.38,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you know that, huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just know! It's a beam! A beam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.51,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you know that, huh?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.51,0:06:42.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just know! It's a beam! A beam!Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.51,0:06:42.72,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Then what kind of beam?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance...Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.05,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Then what kind of beam?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.43,0:06:47.51,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,You were searching for my weak point?! So what?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.44,0:06:57.77,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,I don't have a weak point!Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.77,0:06:59.86,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,All you can do is transform and dodge!Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.86,0:07:02.36,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,If anyone's finished, it's you!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.74,0:07:06.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Found it!Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.12,0:07:09.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His jaw!Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.22,0:07:25.47,Main-207-,CM,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cloven...Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Roseo!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.91,0:07:56.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three minutes.Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.75,0:07:59.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go, reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.63,0:08:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.96,0:08:02.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where is that guy?Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which guy?Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.01,0:08:06.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That tin bastard! He's gone!Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.93,0:08:15.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He came up on his woolly hippo, so he wouldn't go down on his own.Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When the hell did he–Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.85,0:08:20.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While you were glued to the transformations, dumbass!Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.94,0:08:23.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.27,0:08:25.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll go find him and take him down!Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.69,0:08:29.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he got into the castle...Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.78,0:08:31.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If so, Nami...Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.58,0:08:35.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch! If he lays a hand on Nami,Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll chop him into a hundred pieces!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.37,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.50,0:08:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Honestly, does he want to die?Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.50,0:08:48.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell am I even looking at?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this really my Drum Castle?Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.76,0:08:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What have they done to it?Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.27,0:09:00.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They won't get away with this!Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.40,0:09:05.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll chew up every last one of them!Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be resting in bed!Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.99,0:09:15.37,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to scram while Doctorine is gone!Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.79,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't take being  stuck here for three days.Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.96,0:09:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How lucky! I can make  a clean getaway.Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.13,0:09:32.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's... this guy?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.18,0:09:35.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be one of the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.76,0:09:38.77,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He definitely looks like a bad guy!Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.10,0:09:43.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope, I think you've got me mixed up with someone else!Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no clue what  you're talking about!Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.02,0:09:48.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! I'm wrong?! Really?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.57,0:09:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Exactly! I'm just a navigator who's passing through!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.70,0:09:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then, see ya!Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.95,0:09:57.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.75,0:10:02.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Liar!Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.46,0:10:05.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.63,0:10:07.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.08,0:10:04.93,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,You hippo!Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.93,0:10:06.54,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back here!Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.30,0:10:11.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't come this way! Go away!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.31,0:10:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did I put on some weight recently?Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.73,0:10:23.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This calls for...Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Munch-Munch Factory!Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll eat myself!Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.70,0:10:35.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.71,0:10:49.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,H-He turned into a bucket!Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.30,0:10:55.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miraculous bone structure shaping technique... complete!Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.10,0:11:03.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Slim Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.85,0:11:06.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You won't get away.Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.65,0:11:08.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.82,0:11:16.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll eat you first!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Found you!Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.38,0:11:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Was he always that skinny?Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.30,0:11:41.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Care to explain what happened to the jacket I lent you...?Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.93,0:11:45.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much this jacket cost?Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.85,0:11:47.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was 28,800 belly!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's after haggling!Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.36,0:11:53.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but that guy shot a bomb at me!Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.03,0:11:55.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I could do!Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.24,0:12:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously... but oh well. I forgive you.Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.24,0:12:05.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect it to come back in good shape when I let you borrow it.Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.50,0:12:09.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As payment for the damages, you owe triple its value plus interest.Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.25,0:12:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The total is 100,000 belly. Consider it a loan.Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.67,0:12:16.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you planned this from the start!Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.68,0:12:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's it, you filth!Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man, he's sturdy!Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.35,0:12:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.85,0:12:29.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, this is the armory!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.10,0:12:31.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who has the key to this room.Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.36,0:12:35.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Naturally, there's a vast array of weapons inside.Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.53,0:12:37.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I ingest all those weapons...Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.49,0:12:41.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and integrate them with my body using Munch-Munch Shock,Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.78,0:12:48.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'll witness a horrific human weapon!Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.54,0:12:54.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get ready! You'll soil yourselves when this door opens!Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.55,0:12:55.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The key...Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is gone!Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't over.Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.52,0:13:10.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's running away! Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.73,0:13:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got another trump card!Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.40,0:13:18.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just the key to the armory.Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.69,0:13:21.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would've been nice if it were the key to a treasure room.Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.82,0:13:22.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a shame...Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.69,0:13:25.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami my sweet!Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.28,0:13:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! You're safe!Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.16,0:13:32.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you crawling, Sanji? Are you all right?Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.04,0:13:37.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh Nami, are you really that worried about me?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.96,0:13:41.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'm enveloped in that warmth...Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.76,0:13:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit it!Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.39,0:13:45.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Na... mi...Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.43,0:13:50.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait, wait!Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.85,0:13:53.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! The upper levels are full of snow, too!Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.98,0:13:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They'll all pay!Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.86,0:13:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll show them how great a king can be!Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.03,0:14:06.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The power of Drum is my power.Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.41,0:14:08.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll use Drum's ultimate weapon...Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.75,0:14:16.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Royal Drum Tin-Pot Volley Gun!Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got you now! Get ready!Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got you, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.93,0:14:27.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get blown to smithereens!Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.71,0:14:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A bird's nest...!Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.55,0:15:01.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Snow birds!Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.80,0:15:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you make fun of me!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine...Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.48,0:15:17.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He called me...Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.94,0:15:22.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,his friend.Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.16,0:15:29.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never would've thought to find a rope connected to the castle here...Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.66,0:15:32.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A young man in town discovered it by chance.Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.08,0:15:36.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This place used to be Dr. Kureha's house!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a great view!Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.17,0:15:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but isn't this a little overcrowded?Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't let Dalton go alone like this!Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.30,0:15:49.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll fight, too!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.72,0:15:53.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,W-Well, I suppose so, but we'll never get there at this rate!Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Peddle! Peddle faster!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.81,0:16:01.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton, don't push yourself.Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.03,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol...Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.03,0:16:06.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, Dalton?Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.36,0:16:11.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,"No amount of medicine can cure a fool" you say...?Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.24,0:16:15.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling a fool?Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.46,0:16:21.04,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You think you've become the people's champion of justice?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.04,0:16:23.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Get over yourself! You're merely a vassal!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.09,0:16:31.72,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,A week or so in this cell should make you realize your mistake.Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.72,0:16:36.52,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I imagine your impulsive rebellion will have subsided by then.Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.56,0:16:43.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You're an excellent guard, trusted by the citizens.Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.44,0:16:45.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Reconsider it, Dalton.Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.24,0:16:52.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You got caught up in a childish fantasy, all thanks to that quack doctor Hiriluk!Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.66,0:16:54.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What good will abdicating your statusDialogue: 50,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,and destroying the country do you?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll forgive you, DaltonDialogue: 50,0:16:59.33,0:17:02.38,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,but only if you say...Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.34,0:17:09.68,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry" to me, the king.Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To hell with status!Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.27,0:17:18.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To hell with the king!Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.35,0:17:22.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the king!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.98,0:17:26.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm the king of the Kingdom of Drum! I'm the ki–Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.11,0:17:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's over.Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.32,0:17:33.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter...Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.16,0:17:35.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you're a king or a god...!Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.20,0:17:39.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who's great  or who's not great!Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.46,0:17:42.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm a pirate.Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.17,0:17:46.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It does matter, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.55,0:17:50.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Drum is a member of the World Government.Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.63,0:17:51.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen,Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.93,0:17:54.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this is a world-class offense!Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.97,0:17:57.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like I said, that doesn't matter, either!Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.85,0:18:00.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is my own fight!Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.60,0:18:04.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y-You damn straw idiot...!Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.06,0:18:05.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll digest you!Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.36,0:18:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just try!Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.78,0:18:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not yet!Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.86,0:18:13.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Munch-Munch Shock: Tongue Cannon!Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.74,0:18:16.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! His tongue became a cannon!Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.03,0:18:17.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Disappear!Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.89,0:18:37.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton! Please hang in there!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What should we do?Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.77,0:18:42.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton! Dalton!Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.60,0:18:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton!Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.27,0:18:47.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm alright.Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton...Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.62,0:18:59.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure...Dialogue: 50,0:18:59.28,0:19:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to put an end to his tyranny!Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.00,0:19:04.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To hell with history!Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.75,0:19:08.63,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, get a grip, Dalton.Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.63,0:19:13.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You think governance is about caring... for your country?Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Government doesn't need a heart.Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.51,0:19:17.76,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right.Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.76,0:19:19.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What's important is the system.Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.19,0:19:28.19,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.98,0:19:31.82,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me go! Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.82,0:19:35.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I still have a lot of patients to treat!Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.24,0:19:37.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Throw him into the sea!Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.11,0:19:38.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If he resists, kill him.Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.49,0:19:41.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me go! Please!Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.83,0:19:44.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,My patients are waiting for me! Please!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.42,0:19:49.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To hell with this regime!Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.34,0:19:56.34,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Good...Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.89,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So none of them are sick?Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with wanting a country to have a heart?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.81,0:20:13.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Dalton! What are you...?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.73,0:20:12.69,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton...!Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.74,0:20:17.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dynamite!Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.61,0:20:19.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone.Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.28,0:20:22.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once we get to the castle and I'm inside, get down.Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a hippo! He got too cocky!Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.67,0:20:35.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, that's you.Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.38,0:20:38.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One, two...Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.84,0:20:36.09,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.05,0:20:39.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! What're you going to do?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.05,0:20:41.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me go!Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.93,0:20:45.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.81,0:20:48.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crossbow!Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine...Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.29,0:21:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.91,0:21:10.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like... his time has finally come...Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.38,0:21:17.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna mess  with someone's flag,Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.17,0:21:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'd better be ready!Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.30,0:21:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.89,0:21:23.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec!Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.39,0:21:29.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll give you status and a medal!Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.93,0:21:29.27,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum-Gum-Gum-Gum-Gum...Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.73,0:21:32.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look! There's someone on top of the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.65,0:21:39.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.49,0:21:46.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The kingdom...Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.54,0:21:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Drum...Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.83,0:21:56.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then... I'll make you vice king!Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.17,0:21:59.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...is about to fall!Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.26,0:22:03.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.08,0:22:33.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Drum was defeated by the skull and crossbones.Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.39,0:22:51.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not to worry! I'll go scout ahead!Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.39,0:22:52.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.32,0:22:54.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can follow once it's clear.Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.27,0:22:58.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro's going ahead of me again! Serious power, activate!Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.37,0:23:11.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go!Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.91,0:23:13.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! I got your back.Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.37,0:23:16.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're that scared, just wait behind for now!Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.38,0:23:20.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm n-n-not s-s-scared...!Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.21,0:23:22.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-Because I'm...Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.38,0:23:24.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.76,0:23:24.42,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.55,0:23:27.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro?! Usopp?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.69,0:23:41.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you do that for, asshole?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.82,0:23:43.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.40,0:23:47.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those looked like the bad guys' clothes,Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.99,0:23:50.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so I thought you were them!Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.70,0:23:52.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess you guys came up, too.Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.83,0:23:56.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, didn't you say you couldn't make it?Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.83,0:23:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.29,0:24:02.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I see a mountain in front of me, I climb it. I'm that kind of guy.Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.55,0:24:06.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But arriving on this precipice was quite an adventure.Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.55,0:24:08.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We came up by ropeway.Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.26,0:24:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, are Nami and Sanji okay?Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.01,0:24:14.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, they're all better.Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.02,0:24:16.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that!Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.65,0:24:22.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm glad...Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.86,0:24:28.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what were you doing on top of the castle?Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.91,0:24:32.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was beating the crap out of the king.Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.16,0:24:37.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought, the one soaring into the sky was Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.08,0:24:39.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You beat him?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.50,0:24:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep! Why?Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.22,0:24:14.10,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, get it together...Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.02,0:24:17.94,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,We were also attacked by a huge condor on our way!Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.94,0:24:19.52,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Man, was I surprised.Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.90,0:24:22.73,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,But then I was like— or maybe I should say—Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.07,0:24:25.32,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,it's just what you'd expect from me!Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.32,0:24:28.36,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,The moment it dove for my heart,Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.24,0:24:35.00,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Captain Me twirled gracefully out of harm's way and mounted the condor!Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.00,0:24:37.62,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,It was really me!Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.62,0:24:40.88,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,I put a rope around its neck and said,Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.88,0:24:43.59,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,"My name is Captain Usopp!"Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.59,0:24:45.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what about his two top officers?Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.42,0:24:48.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The reindeer beat them up.Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.63,0:24:50.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The reindeer... beat those two...?Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.89,0:24:55.56,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,How's that? Are you guys amazed? Check me out!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.10,0:24:57.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! Usopp, listen! I found a new crewmate!Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.39,0:24:59.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.02,0:25:01.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Reindeer...Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.61,0:25:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A blue nose...Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.08,0:25:16.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.04,0:25:20.04,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I apologize on behalf of all those who laughed at Hiriluk's death,Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.79,0:25:26.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,but you'll needlessly join him if you fight them in this state.Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.80,0:25:33.43,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This country has seen enough sacrifices for one day.Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.68,0:25:38.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're that reindeer...Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.89,0:25:44.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see... You've been fighting all this time since then!Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.32,0:25:52.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.41,0:25:54.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drum will...Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.91,0:25:58.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,definitely be reborn...!Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.21,0:26:11.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's that strange creature?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.17,0:26:12.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A-A reindeer?Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.84,0:26:15.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No... That's...Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.35,0:26:17.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a m-m-m-monst–Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.26,0:26:18.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.81,0:26:21.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:26:21.85,0:26:22.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.98,0:26:25.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.02,0:26:28.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't call him a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:26:28.90,0:26:31.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the new crewmate I was talking about!Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.11,0:26:32.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! That thing is?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.40,0:26:35.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He got shocked and ran away!Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.41,0:26:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Monster!Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.99,0:26:40.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hey! – Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.20,0:26:42.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.75,0:26:45.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.79,0:26:47.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.75,0:26:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're my friend!Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.34,0:26:54.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.05,0:26:57.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're definitely my friend!Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.89,0:26:57.14,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.14,0:26:59.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.76,0:26:59.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is for the best, right?Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.85,0:27:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.85,0:27:01.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.72,0:27:03.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.85,0:27:06.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm waiting!Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.19,0:27:14.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Dalton?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.07,0:27:15.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.70,0:27:17.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just feel a little drained, that's all.Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.99,0:27:20.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.62,0:27:24.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– D-Dr. Kureha! – D-Dr. Kureha!Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.71,0:27:29.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are ya happy, brats?Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.09,0:27:31.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take that injured guy to the medical ward.Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.30,0:27:35.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, you should really finish your medical treatment.Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.68,0:27:36.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.80,0:27:41.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I don't escape now, our departure for Arabasta will be delayed by two days!Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.01,0:27:44.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna keep seeing Vivi suffer?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.10,0:27:46.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit your grumbling, you two,Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.48,0:27:50.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and get back to the medical ward!Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.75,0:28:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As I thought, his injuries have gotten worse since he overexerted himself.Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.09,0:28:17.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now...Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.01,0:28:19.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton.Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.26,0:28:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's the key to the armory? You know where it is, don't you?Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.81,0:28:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The key to the armory... Why do you need such a thing?Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.85,0:28:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.73,0:28:34.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That key... Wapol always kept it on his person.Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.44,0:28:37.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that's still the case, it flew off with him...Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.32,0:28:39.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Is that right?Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.03,0:28:40.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, crap...Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.32,0:28:42.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine...Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.08,0:28:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,About the treatment fee for our crew, would you make it all free?Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.58,0:28:50.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, would you discharge me right away?Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.63,0:28:54.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you just ask for the heck of it knowing that's impossible?Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.63,0:28:58.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As my fee, I'll take all the money and cargo on your ship,Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.05,0:29:02.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and you'll stay here and rest for at least two more days!Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.01,0:29:04.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, she's right!Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.43,0:29:06.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should finish your treatment!Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.31,0:29:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine! It's not like I'm dying anymore!Dialogue: 50,0:29:09.14,0:29:11.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not a good reason!Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.57,0:29:19.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You want the key to the armory, right?Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.95,0:29:21.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.07,0:29:22.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do you have that key?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.78,0:29:24.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that the real one?Dialogue: 50,0:29:24.53,0:29:25.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How'd you get it?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.99,0:29:27.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I stole it.Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.79,0:29:31.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got guts dictating  terms to me like that.Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.62,0:29:34.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're quite the precocious girl.Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.80,0:29:37.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine.Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.51,0:29:41.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't have to pay my fee, but that's all.Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.47,0:29:44.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a doctor, I can't accept the other term.Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.97,0:29:46.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.31,0:29:48.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that case, the deal's off! Give it back!Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.10,0:29:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, girl.Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.27,0:29:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to leave this room now to take care of things.Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.61,0:29:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a wardrobe with my coat in the back room.Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.11,0:30:02.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And it's not like I'm posting guards...Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.16,0:30:06.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Additionally, that young man's backbone treatment is complete.Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.49,0:30:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But listen! Don't you dare run off!Dialogue: 50,0:30:09.91,0:30:12.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys, come with me. I need you for heavy lifting.Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.79,0:30:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yes, ma'am! – Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.80,0:30:23.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She told me to take  her coat, grab Sanji,Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.53,0:30:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and escape while she's gone.Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.89,0:30:29.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... that's how it sounded to me, too.Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.73,0:30:41.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sure ran around a lot.Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.86,0:30:43.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nighttime already...Dialogue: 50,0:30:44.36,0:30:46.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't hear their voices anymore...Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.57,0:30:49.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're gone.Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.91,0:30:51.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This is for the best...Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.91,0:30:54.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't leave this place.Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.00,0:30:57.84,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a full moon tonight...Dialogue: 50,0:30:59.00,0:31:02.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.76,0:31:06.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's be pirates together!Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.47,0:31:06.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're still looking for me!Dialogue: 50,0:31:06.72,0:31:09.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Just give it up already.Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.85,0:31:12.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've been looking for hours with no sign of him.Dialogue: 50,0:31:12.85,0:31:16.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't wanna be a pirate.Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.23,0:31:17.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not true!Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.86,0:31:19.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanna take him with us!Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.98,0:31:23.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like I said, that's what you want, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.74,0:31:26.07,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't wanna go...Dialogue: 50,0:31:26.07,0:31:27.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:31:28.32,0:31:31.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come out, reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.79,0:31:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I won't go!Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.12,0:31:34.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't go!Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.75,0:31:36.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not like those guys!Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.47,0:31:46.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.14,0:31:51.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony!Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.48,0:31:58.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's be pirates together! Okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:59.40,0:32:00.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.Dialogue: 50,0:32:00.48,0:32:03.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could it be impossible when it's so fun?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:03.36,0:32:04.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, that doesn't make sense!Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.40,0:32:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.53,0:32:12.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I'm a reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:32:12.45,0:32:15.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have antlers and hooves...!Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.25,0:32:17.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I even have a blue nose!Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.33,0:32:23.17,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you guys heal the scar in his heart?Dialogue: 50,0:32:25.30,0:32:28.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true... I wanna be a pirate, but...Dialogue: 50,0:32:31.39,0:32:33.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not even a human!Dialogue: 50,0:32:33.64,0:32:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a monster!Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.22,0:32:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't join your crew!Dialogue: 50,0:32:38.23,0:32:39.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 50,0:32:40.48,0:32:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I just came to say thank you...Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.49,0:32:47.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you guys.Dialogue: 50,0:32:48.40,0:32:50.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you for asking me to join you.Dialogue: 50,0:32:55.12,0:32:57.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here, but...Dialogue: 50,0:33:00.37,0:33:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,one day, if you feel like it, stop by agai–Dialogue: 50,0:33:03.09,0:33:04.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:33:04.05,0:33:07.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:33:18.64,0:33:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is “shut up” supposed to be welcoming?Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:03.60,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,The Skies of DrumDialogue: 1,0:01:58.97,0:02:03.60,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,The Skies of DrumDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000 GigglebotDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GabDialogue: 1,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GabDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:07.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TypesettingDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:07.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,TypesettingDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:07.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GabDialogue: 1,0:00:05.73,0:00:07.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GabDialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack Zenef PhosCityDialogue: 1,0:00:07.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack Zenef PhosCityDialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,SoundtrackingDialogue: 1,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,SoundtrackingDialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,HaleeDialogue: 1,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,AphantasticRabbit Poppy Silence WestfalDialogue: 1,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-207-,,0,0